# Hosts the sign-in proxy forwards to, beside Autodesk-hosted Flow PT
# (*.shotgrid.autodesk.com and *.shotgunstudio.com, always allowed).
# For a self-hosted deploy. Exact hosts or *.domain, separated by commas.
# A wildcard matches one label. IPs, ports and local names are refused.
FPT_EXTRA_HOSTS=
